    "title": "Two AKU faculty members have been conferred the Sitara-i-Imtiaz",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Two Aga Khan University faculty members Professor Shaista Masood Khan (Department of Surgery) and Associate Professor Nehal Masood (Department of Oncology and Department of Medicine) have been conferred the prestigious Sitara-i-Imtiaz",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "a7f77af6426b52a5",
        "component": "news_media",
